1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:02,350
(Howard:)left him when
he was 11.

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:04,680
(Penny:)Okay, I will think about it.

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:07,190
(Howard:)You know, I've always
blamed myself

4
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:08,620
(Howard:)for him leaving.

5
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:12,190
(Howard:)I always thought it was because
I wasn't the son he wanted.

6
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,660
(Penny:)Yeah, I said I'd
think about it.

7
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:16,230
(Howard:)I wasn't athletic,
yeah, I was kind of sickly...

8
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:18,900
(Penny:)Okay, fine. Look, look,
I'm calling her now! See?!

9
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,370
(Howard:)Thank you.

10
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:25,140
(Leonard:)So anyway,
Howard asked Penny

11
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:26,970
(Leonard:)to talk to Bernadette,
and she did,

12
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:29,770
(Leonard:)and Bernadette agreed to meet
him for a cup of coffee.

13
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,180
(Katee Sackhoff:)One question.
Yeah?

14
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:33,950
(Sheldon:)Why on earth
are you telling me all this?

15
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,950
(Howard:)I don't know.

16
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:38,350
(Leonard:)Sometimes your movements
are so lifelike,

17
00:00:38,350 --> 00:01:03,020
(Leonard:)I forget you're
not a real boy.

